Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 06:39:38 +0000
Subject: Finish renaming the browser in the remaining strings

An earlier pass renamed Chrome but left Chromium, which is what this build
actually says: is_chrome_branded is false here, so the strings that ship are
the ones inside "if not _google_chrome" branches. The earlier pass had edited
the other side of those branches, which never compiles in this configuration,
so the work was invisible.

Deliberately left alone: the Chromium Projects links, the ChromiumOS strings,
the copyright line, and the project's own name where it appears as the link
text in the credits. The about page now reads that Bare is made possible by the
Chromium open source project, which is the accurate statement.
